  "description": "Photo gallery for the article",
  "prompt": "A list of image objects (url, alt). At least one image must be marked as the cover (a boolean cover flag).",
  "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
  "notes": "The schema represents the gallery as an array of image objects. It uses the 'contains' constraint to ensure at least one item in the list is explicitly marked with 'cover: true'.",
